dashboard/coverage/
serverless/coverage/
electron/coverage/
agent/.coverage
agent/coverage/

# D-130 owner platform certificate, exported by the signing tooling. It is a
# PUBLIC certificate (no private-key material), but it is an owner-custody
# artifact, not source: the PFX that matters stays offline. If it should be
# tracked deliberately, the home for it is firmware/PblPkg/ next to
# pbl-test-signing.crt — not the repo root.
*-RemoteLockdownPlatformKey.pem
agent/htmlcov/
